      "title": "Paste only plaintext to Lua console input text field",
      "message": "Paste only plaintext to Lua console input text field\n\nSome IDEs like VS Code put the syntax highlighting and theming into the\nclipboard on copy. Pasting such clipboard contents in the Lua console\ninput field results in weird formatting which can't be easily cleared by\nthe user.\n",
      "author_name": "Štěpán Balážik",
      "author_email": "stepan@balazik.cz",
